SUMMARY:AAPP 2027 Annual Meeting
DESCRIPTION:The American Association of Psychiatric Pharmacists\, formerl
 y the College of Psychiatric and Neurologic Pharmacists\, holds its 2027
  annual meeting at The Galt House Hotel in Louisville\, Kentucky\, from 
 April 4 to 7\, 2027. The organization renamed itself from CPNP to AAPP i
 n 2022 and continues to use the name Annual Meeting for this event.\n\nD
 eadlines\nAbstract submission: 2026-12-01 (estimated)\n\nhttps://aapp.or
 g/ed/meeting/2027
LOCATION:Louisville\, Kentucky\, The Galt House Hotel
URL:https://aapp.org/ed/meeting/2027
